const exits = [
  ['All left / right / top / bottom','One connector bank and a consistent cable direction.','Interior electrodes must escape past exterior ones; bank length grows with channel count.'],
  ['Split left / right or top / bottom','Distributes fan-out across opposite edges.','Multiple banks and tails need packaging; pad order can still force crossings.'],
  ['Interleaved left / right','Alternates channel destinations while keeping a one-to-one netlist.','Alternation can increase detours and routing congestion. It has no assumed biological advantage.'],
  ['Alternating rows or columns','Keeps a regular row / column assignment for inspection.','The pattern can be harder to route than spatially splitting an array; compare layers and order.'],
  ['Nearest of four sides','Offers more escape edges for dense arrays.','Four tails or perimeter packaging can be impractical for a particular implant location.'],
